# Cloudflare Pages response headers. The page's <meta> CSP (injected at build time) can't
# set frame-ancestors, so it is sent here. Calls need the microphone, camera and screen
# capture: don't restrict them in Permissions-Policy.
# The container image sets the same headers in ../Caddyfile; keep the two in step
# (test/webHeaders.test.ts checks).
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), payment=()
